###### NAME EIGRP METRIC CALC

GIVEN VALUES:
Min = 10 000
Total Delay = 1010

1. THROUGHPUT
 =10^7 * 65536 / MIN BW
 = 655 360 000 000 / 10 000
 = 65 536 000

2. LATENCY
  = TotalDelay psec (6 na 0) * 65536 / 10^6
  = 1 010 000 000 * 65536 / 1 000 000
  = 66 191 360 000 000 / 1 000 000
  = 66 191 360

3. Composite Metric
 = THROUGHPUT + LATENCY
 = 65 536 000 + 66 191 360
 = 131 727 360

4. RIB - SCALE
 = Composite Metric / Rib-SCALE
 = 131 727 360 / 128
 = 1 029 120

==============================================================
***ACTIVITY***

GIVEN VALUES:
Min = 10 000
Total Delay = 10 000 + 1000 + 10 = 11 010

1. THROUGHPUT
 =10^7 * 65536 / MIN BW
 = 655 360 000 000 / 10 000
 = 65 536 000

2. LATENCY
  = TotalDelay psec (6 na 0) * 65536 / 10^6
  = 11 010 000 000 * 65536 / 1 000 000 / 1 000 000
  = 721 551 360 000 000 / 1 000 000
  = 721 551 360

3. Composite Metric
 = THROUGHPUT + LATENCY
 = 65 536 000 + 721 551 360
 = 787 087 360

4. RIB - SCALE
 = Composite Metric / Rib-SCALE
 = 787 087 360 / 128
 = 6 149 120
 
